  "description": "CR 709.3, 709.5d, 709.5e, 709.5h, 115.1: Grand Entryway, cast as a door, creates a 1/1 white Glimmer token as it unlocks; unlocking Elegant Rotunda then puts a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two target creatures, any controller's",
